        "A boss arena shaped like a bookshelf: on one side a psychologist and a woman talk over an enshrined Hemingway volume while posters of Bob Dylan, Joni Mitchell and Van Morrison glow and an Einstein quotation scrolls past a MySpace name, and on the other side a chat window scrolls love, glad, furious and pissed while a scale weighs intuition against research.",
